{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From Unemployed to Model Employee!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the tricks of various professions, attend training courses, take on different contracts, improve your skills, and don\u2019t forget to pay your bills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware, your duties don\u2019t end there. You\u2019ll also need to investigate and uncover the mysterious stories hidden in these places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each contract requires a certain level of skill, which you can gain by attending training or working on the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A contract to clean a supposedly &quot;haunted&quot; house? No problem! Take training to become a janitor and another to become a ghost hunter, and you\u2019ll have the skills to apply!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working is fine, but earning money is better: upgrade your equipment, pay your bills\u2026 You\u2019ll need to manage your money carefully, or you could find yourself in a tricky situation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INVESTIGATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the contracts you\u2019ll be offered are ones nobody wants, for reasons that aren\u2019t always very clear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to the location, do what\u2019s expected of you, and investigate to find out the real reasons. You might even earn a bonus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2251270?t=1770477179","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2251270/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770477179","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2251270/5b79f09cff91d7e1076d986df073c9f8f973a980/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770477179","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2251270/5b79f09cff91d7e1076d986df073c9f8f973a980/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770477179","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From Unemployed to Model Employee!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the tricks of various professions, attend training courses, take on different contracts, improve your skills, and don\u2019t forget to pay your bills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware, your duties don\u2019t end there. You\u2019ll also need to investigate and uncover the mysterious stories hidden in these places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each contract requires a certain level of skill, which you can gain by attending training or working on the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A contract to clean a supposedly &quot;haunted&quot; house? No problem! Take training to become a janitor and another to become a ghost hunter, and you\u2019ll have the skills to apply!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working is fine, but earning money is better: upgrade your equipment, pay your bills\u2026 You\u2019ll need to manage your money carefully, or you could find yourself in a tricky situation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INVESTIGATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the contracts you\u2019ll be offered are ones nobody wants, for reasons that aren\u2019t always very clear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to the location, do what\u2019s expected of you, and investigate to find out the real reasons. You might even earn a bonus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Cryptic Dog Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai